WEBVTT

00:00:01.114 --> 00:00:12.992
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.226 --> 00:00:18.799
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:25.728
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:37.209
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.451 --> 00:00:43.390
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:50.796
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:58.605
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:05.479
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.479 --> 00:01:11.084
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.084 --> 00:01:17.357
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:25.787
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:38.478 --> 00:01:40.207
What the?

00:01:43.717 --> 00:01:45.947
What are you doing sneaking around?!

00:01:50.624 --> 00:01:53.457
Oh my goodness!
What are you two doing here?

00:01:54.928 --> 00:01:57.297
-This is my mom.
-Good heavens!

00:01:57.297 --> 00:01:58.865
Aren't those my clothes?!

00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:00.901
Letting her wear these ugly, old things.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:03.470
There are cuter clothes than this, Thoma!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.806
Well, anyway, let's all go to the house.

00:02:05.806 --> 00:02:07.140
Is it really okay, Mom?

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.576
A little girl can't live like a monkey.

00:02:14.548 --> 00:02:17.312
Come on, you come in here, Helga.

00:02:18.618 --> 00:02:21.354
I'll bring you a change of clothes.

00:02:21.354 --> 00:02:25.586
Thoma, I'm going to wash Chitto's
clothes, too, so lend him some of yours.

00:02:31.331 --> 00:02:36.234
A WARM FAMILY

00:02:37.904 --> 00:02:39.973
Now what would look nice...

00:02:39.973 --> 00:02:43.643
I know I had some cute clothes that
I bought in Natsuna a long time ago.

00:02:43.643 --> 00:02:46.012
Shouldn't you go to work, Mom?

00:02:46.012 --> 00:02:47.781
Won't there be a lot of tourists today

00:02:47.781 --> 00:02:49.416
because of the festival at
Natsuna Temple?

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:52.786
What are you talking about?
Your friends are here!

00:02:52.786 --> 00:02:54.788
I'm taking the day off today.

00:02:54.788 --> 00:02:56.823
Ah-ha! Here it is!

00:02:56.823 --> 00:02:58.792
Come on! Don't just stand around!

00:02:58.792 --> 00:03:00.760
You're in the way!

00:03:03.897 --> 00:03:06.889
It's taking forever.
What're they doing?

00:03:09.469 --> 00:03:11.198
Come on!

00:03:17.244 --> 00:03:21.442
What do you think, Thoma?
She looks like a princess, doesn't she?

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:26.553
You're right! She's a princess!

00:03:26.553 --> 00:03:29.113
All I had to do was shorten it
a little bit and it fit.

00:03:29.322 --> 00:03:32.587
Who would have thought my old
clothes would come in handy like this?

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.020
Come on, Helga.
I'll bet you're hungry.

00:03:45.105 --> 00:03:49.009
Huh?! Why, Mom?
Hold on a minute!

00:03:49.009 --> 00:03:52.846
But Thoma, we have to
contact the orphanage.

00:03:52.846 --> 00:03:56.873
Didn't I just tell you?
Helga was being mistreated there!

00:03:58.752 --> 00:04:00.982
I don't know...

00:04:01.187 --> 00:04:04.891
Okay, I'll ask if they can
stay here for a little while.

00:04:04.891 --> 00:04:06.426
You don't get it, do you?

00:04:06.426 --> 00:04:09.262
If you do that the guys from the
orphanage are gonna come right over.

00:04:09.262 --> 00:04:12.799
Even so, Thoma, they
aren't kittens or puppies.

00:04:12.799 --> 00:04:15.427
If we leave things like this,
there'll be even more trouble.

00:04:15.468 --> 00:04:17.804
Geez, if I'd known you were
gonna do this,

00:04:17.804 --> 00:04:20.238
I wouldn't have listened to what you said!

00:04:22.709 --> 00:04:25.312
I see, so they're at your house.

00:04:25.312 --> 00:04:27.414
That must be very inconvenient for you.

00:04:27.414 --> 00:04:29.883
However, the fact that
those children ran away

00:04:29.883 --> 00:04:32.750
is actually all the fault of
a government agency.

00:04:33.687 --> 00:04:37.891
Yes, they weren't allowing anyone
to leave the orphanage for a time,

00:04:37.891 --> 00:04:41.019
so it is not the responsibility
of the orphanage personnel.

00:04:41.094 --> 00:04:45.394
But...
Hello? Hello?

00:04:48.001 --> 00:04:51.071
I can't believe him!
What a horrible director!

00:04:51.071 --> 00:04:54.474
Listen, all of you, as far as I'm
concerned you can stay here forever!

00:04:54.474 --> 00:04:56.209
Okay?

00:04:56.209 --> 00:04:59.940
That's great!
Good job, Mom! Yahoo!

00:05:01.448 --> 00:05:04.679
Hey! That hurts, Thoma!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.786
Okay, I'll see you at next month's meeting.

00:05:14.961 --> 00:05:18.362
What happened? Didn't
you go to Natsuna today?

00:05:18.565 --> 00:05:21.267
Anyway, it seems like all the
temples are having problems.

00:05:21.267 --> 00:05:23.236
You know the temple on Igake Island?

00:05:23.236 --> 00:05:27.140
The caretaker is moving to the
mainland to be with his kids.

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:30.405
Who can live on an island without
electricity in this day and age?

00:05:31.811 --> 00:05:34.780
Hey, honey, are you listening?

00:05:34.848 --> 00:05:36.916
What was that?

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:38.985
Who were you talking to?

00:05:38.985 --> 00:05:40.953
Weren't you...?

00:05:48.928 --> 00:05:53.933
Thoma! After all, I was
once cute just like Helga.

00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:55.468
Right, honey?

00:05:55.468 --> 00:05:58.460
But they get cheekier as
they get older! Right, Chitto?

00:06:01.741 --> 00:06:04.177
-That was close!
-Oh, dear me!

00:06:04.177 --> 00:06:05.712
Well, make yourselves at home.

00:06:05.712 --> 00:06:07.976
Though it's just a temple
that stinks of incense.

00:06:08.081 --> 00:06:11.482
Ma'am, sir, thank you for letting us stay.

00:06:12.852 --> 00:06:14.888
Well, aren't you polite.

00:06:14.888 --> 00:06:17.721
And here I thought all boys
were like Thoma.

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:19.759
I guess there are all kinds of kids!

00:06:19.759 --> 00:06:21.750
Maybe my parents didn't
teach me very well.

00:06:21.895 --> 00:06:24.964
-Oh? Maybe I should be more strict!
-Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:06:24.964 --> 00:06:27.333
I get it, Mom! Come on, that hurts!

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:30.063
Hey, Chitto! Help me! Ow, ow, ow!

00:06:31.337 --> 00:06:33.273
Oh, that's my grandfather.

00:06:33.273 --> 00:06:36.309
He mastered the secrets of
the Papin fighting style.

00:06:36.309 --> 00:06:39.176
But then he was killed by killer bees.

00:06:39.746 --> 00:06:44.809
That's why I'm always telling
Thoma to be careful of those bees.

00:06:46.553 --> 00:06:48.714
You two should be careful also.

00:06:48.788 --> 00:06:50.657
What's wrong, Thoma?

00:06:50.657 --> 00:06:52.648
Oh, it's nothing.

00:06:56.996 --> 00:06:59.726
-Well?
-I don't know.

00:07:01.935 --> 00:07:03.970
Have you seen this before?

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.705
No.

00:07:05.705 --> 00:07:07.774
I see. Thank you.

00:07:07.774 --> 00:07:09.639
Let's go!

00:07:16.516 --> 00:07:18.585
Soreto is really late.

00:07:18.585 --> 00:07:21.748
I hope she's been able
to find some kind of lead.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.128
Are you worried?

00:07:30.396 --> 00:07:33.092
What Hesma said about me is true.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.232
I'm just weak, that's all.

00:07:36.603 --> 00:07:40.403
It can't be helped.
We're all exhausted.

00:07:44.177 --> 00:07:47.510
We... can't love anyone.

00:07:47.614 --> 00:07:50.416
Not parents or siblings or lovers.

00:07:50.416 --> 00:07:52.407
Never.

00:07:56.756 --> 00:07:59.816
I'd like to... go see Wonder.

00:08:03.663 --> 00:08:06.132
-Shall we go?
-But...

00:08:06.132 --> 00:08:08.234
It'll be okay if it's only for a little while.

00:08:08.234 --> 00:08:10.930
She'll be happy, too! Come on!

00:08:15.241 --> 00:08:18.011
I've seen this somewhere before.

00:08:18.011 --> 00:08:21.147
Somewhere on the islands around here.
Right, Mom?

00:08:21.147 --> 00:08:25.552
Really? But there's no
place like this around here.

00:08:25.552 --> 00:08:27.679
Is this a building?

00:08:29.255 --> 00:08:33.026
Well, if it's not a building, then
maybe it's some kind of machine?

00:08:33.026 --> 00:08:36.763
That's dumb, Mom! There
are no machines like that!

00:08:36.763 --> 00:08:39.465
Helga is looking for a place! A place!

00:08:39.465 --> 00:08:41.456
Right, Helga?

00:08:43.169 --> 00:08:45.637
She really doesn't know for sure.

00:08:45.738 --> 00:08:47.807
Do you recognize it, honey?

00:08:47.807 --> 00:08:49.576
Well...

00:08:49.576 --> 00:08:51.444
There's not much to go on.

00:08:51.444 --> 00:08:54.714
What do you mean?! You
do fortune telling for a living!

00:08:54.714 --> 00:08:58.251
This is something really important
to Helga! Take it more seriously!

00:08:58.251 --> 00:09:00.086
Here, your tools.

00:09:00.086 --> 00:09:04.648
Mom's fortune telling is so accurate,
they call her "The Mother of Natsuna."

00:09:08.228 --> 00:09:10.897
How about it, Mom? See anything?

00:09:10.897 --> 00:09:14.162
Well, I'm not getting cards
that show a direction.

00:09:14.801 --> 00:09:17.036
-Oh!
-What? What?

00:09:17.036 --> 00:09:21.174
-This is very strange.
-Yeah! We got it!

00:09:21.174 --> 00:09:24.610
Helga has a sibling who
feels very strongly about her.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.782
You don't have an older
or younger brother?

00:09:29.782 --> 00:09:32.185
Helga is an only child, ma'am.

00:09:32.185 --> 00:09:36.918
That's strange. This card
is the symbol for siblings.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.726
And you see how the
moon is being pulled?

00:09:39.726 --> 00:09:43.287
It means strong emotions are
being directed toward Helga.

00:09:45.531 --> 00:09:47.500
-I'm sorry.
-Geez!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.204
She's not looking for a person!
She's looking for a place! A place!

00:09:51.204 --> 00:09:54.741
I know! Your dancing! Your powers
won't work if you don't do that dance!

00:09:54.741 --> 00:09:57.301
Dancing? What do you mean?

00:09:58.878 --> 00:10:02.916
Dancing! Dancing! Chitto, now you're
going to see something really fun!

00:10:02.916 --> 00:10:06.477
Come on! Why are you so
embarrassed, Mom? Hurry up and do it!

00:10:06.953 --> 00:10:08.818
Y-You...

00:10:09.255 --> 00:10:11.224
Idiot!

00:10:11.224 --> 00:10:14.294
If Thoma remembers it
there might be a picture somewhere.

00:10:14.294 --> 00:10:16.262
Okay, here we go.

00:10:16.262 --> 00:10:19.098
-It's not here, Thoma.
-Look for it carefully!

00:10:19.098 --> 00:10:21.167
You and Dad just don't
remember, that's all!

00:10:21.167 --> 00:10:23.499
Saying that doesn't make
it so. Right, honey?

00:10:24.237 --> 00:10:26.171
Dancing...

00:10:26.839 --> 00:10:28.830
What's this?

00:10:29.175 --> 00:10:33.046
Oh, this is from when we visited
Lake Kachan on the Eastern Mainland.

00:10:33.046 --> 00:10:34.981
That's right! That was when we had

00:10:34.981 --> 00:10:37.108
all that trouble because
the boat flipped over.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.685
What are you talking about?!

00:10:38.685 --> 00:10:41.984
You threw a tantrum because
you wanted to paddle the boat!

00:10:42.155 --> 00:10:43.990
Was that it?

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:48.461
Anyway, I fell into the lake.
I thought I was gonna die!

00:10:48.461 --> 00:10:52.765
Look, Thoma looks so silly in this
one from when we went to the zoo.

00:10:52.765 --> 00:10:55.501
I just look cute and innocent!

00:10:55.501 --> 00:11:00.200
Honey, this is from the wedding of
the Igake Temple caretaker's son.

00:11:00.606 --> 00:11:04.477
Thoma was running around and
causing trouble that time, too.

00:11:04.477 --> 00:11:07.640
-Do you remember that, Thoma?
-I don't remember that!

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.983
For goodness sake,
you're always like that!

00:11:09.983 --> 00:11:11.814
Don't you have any cool pictures of me?

00:11:13.853 --> 00:11:16.255
I'm sorry, we can't seem to find it.

00:11:16.255 --> 00:11:19.092
Helga, may I take one of these pictures?

00:11:19.092 --> 00:11:21.754
I might remember
something at some point.

00:11:23.296 --> 00:11:27.062
Now then, let's have dinner early tonight.

00:11:27.767 --> 00:11:30.531
Helga, you can help me.

00:11:31.137 --> 00:11:32.839
Okay?

00:11:32.839 --> 00:11:34.941
Are there any foods you don't like, Chitto?

00:11:34.941 --> 00:11:38.411
Well, I'll eat pretty much
anything except balsam pear.

00:11:38.411 --> 00:11:41.676
Great! Balsam pear is
the only thing I hate, too!

00:11:56.596 --> 00:11:59.258
Wonder! Dive through that cloud!

00:12:12.512 --> 00:12:16.149
It's been 500 years,
but she's still running perfectly.

00:12:16.149 --> 00:12:19.652
Of course! We never know when we're
going to be contacted by the others.

00:12:19.652 --> 00:12:23.748
And as her creator, I have to
make sure she's properly maintained.

00:12:25.191 --> 00:12:28.456
Sometimes, I've secretly
taken her out flying.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:35.568
In the forest, she got tangled up
in tree roots and covered in moss.

00:12:35.568 --> 00:12:40.369
If we didn't call for her, she would
just stay hidden like that forever.

00:12:43.443 --> 00:12:46.003
But even Wonder is lonely like that.

00:12:46.279 --> 00:12:48.213
Right, Wonder?

00:12:51.017 --> 00:12:54.612
See! She's happy to see
you again, Hasmodye!

00:13:02.695 --> 00:13:07.189
You're the only one I can
share my feelings with.

00:13:08.835 --> 00:13:10.928
It's the same for Wonder.

00:13:11.838 --> 00:13:13.738
She has no one but us.

00:13:37.163 --> 00:13:39.393
You were riding Wonder, weren't you?

00:13:44.937 --> 00:13:46.706
Aghi! Please stop!

00:13:46.706 --> 00:13:49.197
Tarlant did it for me!

00:13:49.575 --> 00:13:51.410
I asked him to!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.312
Don't be a spoiled brat!

00:13:53.312 --> 00:13:57.646
Thoughtless actions like that could
have serious consequences for us!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.091
Take that!

00:14:13.266 --> 00:14:15.166
Cut it out, Thoma!

00:14:17.503 --> 00:14:19.438
Did you say a stone statue moved?

00:14:19.438 --> 00:14:22.742
Yeah! A stone statue on Kokkuri Island.

00:14:22.742 --> 00:14:25.711
It just attacked me all of a sudden!

00:14:25.711 --> 00:14:29.515
You really are hopeless.
Stone statues don't move.

00:14:29.515 --> 00:14:31.350
Come on now, you're spilling all over.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.183
Well, just ask Chitto then.
Right, Chitto?

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.220
Yeah, it's true.

00:14:37.757 --> 00:14:40.225
Helga, did you see it, too?

00:14:40.693 --> 00:14:44.322
Helga wasn't with us so
she didn't see anything.

00:14:46.566 --> 00:14:51.270
Some people do say that if your faith
is strong enough, statues will move.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.261
But it's a strange story.

00:14:53.573 --> 00:14:55.939
Alright, enough of that.

00:14:56.075 --> 00:14:59.306
Helga, why don't you and I
go and get washed up?

00:14:59.478 --> 00:15:01.981
Thoma, go set up a bed for Chitto.

00:15:01.981 --> 00:15:03.471
Alright.

00:15:09.455 --> 00:15:11.821
Girls are just so nice.

00:15:11.958 --> 00:15:14.927
I wish we could keep
the two of you with us.

00:15:15.995 --> 00:15:19.294
Your hair is really soft, Helga.

00:15:20.399 --> 00:15:22.959
What do you want to be
when you grow up, Helga?

00:15:23.135 --> 00:15:26.536
A teacher maybe? Or are
you going to be an artist?

00:15:29.175 --> 00:15:31.973
Those pictures are very beautiful.

00:15:37.883 --> 00:15:42.411
What's the matter?
Did I say something wrong?

00:15:46.626 --> 00:15:48.253
I'm sorry.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.068
You're a very gentle girl, Helga.

00:15:57.303 --> 00:15:59.931
That's perfectly clear to me.

00:17:19.185 --> 00:17:22.211
Okay, Chitto, if you
scare him he'll run away.

00:17:22.421 --> 00:17:24.013
Yeah.

00:17:29.662 --> 00:17:31.857
Here he comes!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.095
Wow!!

00:17:39.972 --> 00:17:41.741
Come on, Amedio!

00:17:41.741 --> 00:17:43.504
Amedio?

00:17:46.045 --> 00:17:48.214
It's very hard to get him to feed.

00:17:48.214 --> 00:17:50.449
I've finally got him used to me.

00:17:50.449 --> 00:17:52.451
He's just really shy.

00:17:52.451 --> 00:17:54.620
Here. Give it a try, Chitto.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.611
Amedio.

00:18:01.093 --> 00:18:02.928
He's eating! He's eating!

00:18:02.928 --> 00:18:05.297
I know! Let's show him to Helga, too.

00:18:05.297 --> 00:18:07.533
Just move really slowly, Chitto!

00:18:07.533 --> 00:18:09.000
Okay!

00:18:15.274 --> 00:18:17.105
There she is!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.310
Helga!

00:18:29.789 --> 00:18:31.347
Helga?

00:18:39.498 --> 00:18:41.625
Were you looking at the sea?

00:18:42.535 --> 00:18:44.127
Oh.

00:18:50.409 --> 00:18:52.278
Um...

00:18:52.278 --> 00:18:55.247
Hey, Helga, you want to
go to that place, right?

00:18:55.247 --> 00:18:57.841
I'll look for it with you!

00:18:58.584 --> 00:19:02.021
After all, three people are more
reassuring than two, right?

00:19:02.021 --> 00:19:04.790
Besides, I know the geography
around here pretty well.

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.781
I think that could be helpful!

00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:18.094
Thoma, you have such a
kind father and mother.

00:19:20.039 --> 00:19:24.908
My parents died right after I was born.

00:19:25.711 --> 00:19:29.670
If you left here, they would be very sad.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.441
Besides...

00:19:33.786 --> 00:19:38.985
Besides, it's as if I don't know anything
about the place I'm looking for.

00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:41.657
Helga...

00:19:43.562 --> 00:19:45.631
-Helga?
-Yeah.

00:19:45.631 --> 00:19:47.500
That's the picture Helga drew.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:50.302
Helga? A girl named
Helga? Look very carefully.

00:19:50.302 --> 00:19:52.972
She really drew this picture?
There's no mistake?

00:19:52.972 --> 00:19:56.567
It's true. After all, she always
drew the same picture.

00:19:57.209 --> 00:19:59.311
How old is that girl? What's her age?

00:19:59.311 --> 00:20:02.075
She's the same age as me, 11 years old.

00:20:07.786 --> 00:20:09.686
This is the city of Clairmont.

00:20:10.689 --> 00:20:15.149
It all started here 111 years ago.

00:20:24.703 --> 00:20:26.338
Flo!

00:20:26.338 --> 00:20:29.208
-Come on, Alice!
-W-What is it?!

00:20:29.208 --> 00:20:30.809
Helga! Helga!

00:20:30.809 --> 00:20:34.905
We all moved here from Kremer.
Helga is probably still there.

00:20:34.947 --> 00:20:36.015
Kremer?!

00:20:36.015 --> 00:20:39.212
Soon! We're going to
see her soon! See her!

00:20:41.887 --> 00:20:43.422
Ah! Blast it!

00:20:43.422 --> 00:20:46.391
What happened? Why did you run off?

00:20:46.458 --> 00:20:48.460
-It was Flo!
-What?!

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.530
That face... It was Flo at 11 years old.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.293
There's no mistake!

00:21:37.376 --> 00:21:38.968
Flo?!

00:21:39.111 --> 00:21:40.772
Flo!

00:21:42.815 --> 00:21:45.215
-It's Father!
-Flo!

00:21:45.751 --> 00:21:47.219
Flo!

00:21:47.219 --> 00:21:50.484
Father... He's so worn out.

00:21:53.726 --> 00:21:57.594
Flo, I wonder how long I'll be able
to let you ride on my shoulders?

00:22:00.766 --> 00:22:03.997
Flo! Flo!

00:22:06.472 --> 00:22:08.406
Flo!!

00:22:10.476 --> 00:22:14.572
Flo! Flo!

00:22:15.047 --> 00:22:17.345
Flo!!

00:22:35.401 --> 00:22:45.208
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.477 --> 00:22:55.254
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.254 --> 00:22:59.987
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.092 --> 00:23:04.927
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:14.466
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.573 --> 00:23:19.645
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.645 --> 00:23:24.850
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.850 --> 00:23:29.253
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.354 --> 00:23:33.659
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.659 --> 00:23:38.528
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
